    "updated_at": "2023-10-09T12:18:19Z",
    "body": "Browsers implement https://url.spec.whatwg.org which has no such rule. In particular a base URL is just a specially designated URL, that's it. There are certain places where we serialize without fragment identifier, but `baseURI` is not one of those places.",
